<item>
  <title>Figures layout</title>
  <dc:creator>Marie Gradeler</dc:creator>
  <link>https://gradelerm.github.io/posts/maps_package.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<section id="test-des-layouts" class="level2 page-columns page-full">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="test-des-layouts">Test des layouts</h2>
<p>Classique, on n’ajoute rien.</p>
<div class="cell">
<div class="cell-output-display">
<div>
<figure class="figure">
<p><img src="https://gradelerm.github.io/posts/maps_package_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png" class="img-fluid figure-img" width="672"></p>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>On utilise plus d’espace pour afficher une figure en plus large.</p>
<div class="cell page-columns page-full">
<div class="cell-output-display page-columns page-full">
<div class="page-columns page-full">
<figure class="figure page-columns page-full">
<p class="page-columns page-full"><img src="https://gradelerm.github.io/posts/maps_package_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png" class="img-fluid figure-img column-screen-inset-shaded" width="672"></p>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>On peut aussi afficher les figures dans la marge, il semblerait.</p>
<div class="cell page-columns page-full">

<div class="no-row-height column-margin column-container"><div class="cell-output-display">
<div>
<figure class="figure">
<p><img src="https://gradelerm.github.io/posts/maps_package_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png" class="img-fluid figure-img" width="672"></p>
</figure>
</div>
</div></div></div>


</section>

 ]]></description>
